#: .\t2_adt5\templates\t2_adt5\p2_Comprehension4.html:264
msgid "Hint:"
msgstr "Ledtråd:"

#: .\t1_adt2\templates\t1_adt2\p2_Comprehension2.html:268
msgid ""
"Remember that the table at the top shows the return of asset A (left column) "
"and asset B (right column) per SEK invested in case the coin comes up heads "
"(top row) or tails (bottom row)."
msgstr ""
"Kom ihåg att tabellen visar avkastningen på tillgång A (vänster kolumn) och "
"tillgång B (höger kolumn) per SEK investerat i respektive tillgång om myntet "
"visar krona (översta raden) eller klave (nedersta raden)."

#: .\t1_adt2\templates\t1_adt2\p2_Comprehension3.html:110
msgid ""
"If 100 SEK are put into <b>asset A</b>, how much does <br/> the investment "
"pay if the coin comes up <b>heads</b>?"
msgstr ""
"Om 100 SEK investeras i <b>tillgång A</b>, hur mycket avkastar <br/> "
"investeringen om myntet visar <b>krona</b>?"

#: .\t1_adt2\templates\t1_adt2\p2_Comprehension3.html:268
#: .\t2_adt5\templates\t2_adt5\p2_Comprehension3.html:267
msgid ""
"Remember that the table depicts how much the asset pays per SEK invested. "
"Thus, if, for instance, 50 SEK are put into an asset, the investment pays 50 "
"times the return of the asset."
msgstr ""
"Kom ihåg att tabellen visar hur mycket tillgången betalar per SEK "
"investerat. Om exempelvis 50 SEK investeras i en tillgång, betalar "
"investeringen 50 gånger tillgångens avkastning."

#: .\t1_adt2\templates\t1_adt2\p2_Comprehension3.html:275
msgid ""
"So for example, if the return on that asset is 2.00 SEK if Heads comes up, "
"you will receive 2 x 50 = 100 SEK from that investment (if Heads comes up)."
msgstr ""
"Till exempel, om avkastningen på den tillgången är 2,00 SEK om myntet visar "
"krona får du 2 x 50 = 100 SEK om myntet visar krona."

#: .\t1_adt2\templates\t1_adt2\p2_Comprehension4.html:110
msgid ""
"In this example, 30 SEK is invested in Asset A and 70 SEK is invested in "
"Asset B.<br/> How much does the <b>portfolio</b> - that is, the amount "
"put<br/> into both assets - pay if the coin comes up <b>tails</b><br/> "
"(excluding the initial endowment of 100 SEK)?"
msgstr ""
"I det här exemplet har 30 SEK investerats i Tillgång A och 70 SEK "
"investerats i Tillgång B.<br/> Hur mycket avkastar <b>portföljen</b> - det "
"vill säga investeringarna <br/> i båda tillgångarna - om myntet visar "
"<b>klave</b> <br/> (exklusive de 100 SEK du erhåller för att delta)?"

#: .\t1_adt2\templates\t1_adt2\p2_Comprehension4.html:270
msgid ""
"Note that asset A pays 0.00 SEK in case the coin shows up tails. Moreover, "
"take into consideration how much has been invested into each of the two "
"assets."
msgstr ""
"Observera att tillgång A betalar 0,00 SEK om myntet visar klave. Ta också "
"hänsyn till hur mycket som har investerats i var och en av de två "
"tillgångarna."

#: .\t1_adt2\templates\t1_adt2\p2_Start.html:55
#: .\t2_adt5\templates\t2_adt5\p2_Start.html:55
msgid ""
"Now you will begin with the investment decisions that are relevant for your "
"client's payout."
msgstr ""
"På nästa sida börjar investeringsbesluten som bestämmer dina kunders "
"ersättning."

#: .\t1_adt2\templates\t1_adt2\p2_Start.html:60
#: .\t2_adt5\templates\t2_adt5\p2_Start.html:60
msgid ""
"Now you will begin with the investment decisions that are relevant for your "
"and your client's payout."
msgstr ""
"På nästa sida börjar investeringsbesluten som bestämmer din och dina kunders "
"ersättning."

#: .\t1_adt2\templates\t1_adt2\p2_Start.html:65
#: .\t2_adt5\templates\t2_adt5\p2_Start.html:65
msgid ""
"Now you will begin with the investment decisions that are relevant for your "
"payout."
msgstr ""
"På nästa sida börjar investeringsbesluten som bestämmer din ersättning."

#: .\t1_adt2\templates\t1_adt2\p2_Start.html:73
#: .\t2_adt5\templates\t2_adt5\p2_Start.html:73
msgid ""
"Remember that any of the investment decisions can be the one your clients "
"may be paid for. So, make each decision very carefully."
msgstr ""
"Kom ihåg att något av besluten kan vara det som bestämmer dina kunders "
"ersättning så var noggrann."

#: .\t1_adt2\templates\t1_adt2\p2_Start.html:78
#: .\t2_adt5\templates\t2_adt5\p2_Start.html:78
msgid ""
"Remember that any of the investment decisions can be the one you and your "
"clients may be paid for. So, make each decision very carefully."
msgstr ""
"Kom ihåg att något av besluten kan vara det som bestämmer din samt var och "
"en av dina kunders ersättning så var noggrann."

#: .\t1_adt2\templates\t1_adt2\p2_Start.html:83
#: .\t2_adt5\templates\t2_adt5\p2_Start.html:83
msgid ""
"Remember that any of the investment decisions can be the one you may be paid "
"for. So, make each decision very carefully."
msgstr ""
"Kom ihåg att något av besluten kan vara det som bestämmer din ersättning så "
"var noggrann."

#: .\t1_adt2\templates\t1_adt2\p2_Start.html:91
#, python-format
msgid ""
"<b>Note:</b> Your clients indicate that they want you to make your decisions "
"on their behalf on the following risk level: <b>%(risk_level)s out of 4</b> "
"(1 refers to \"please do not take any risk at all\" while 4 refers to "
"\"please maximize the expected payoff regardless of the risk involved\")."
msgstr ""
"<b>Obs!</b> Dina kunder anger att de vill att du ska ta beslut givet "
"följande risknivå: <b>%(risk_level)s av 4</b>."

#: .\t1_adt2\templates\t1_adt2\p2_Start.html:100
#: .\t2_adt5\templates\t2_adt5\p2_Start.html:100
msgid "Happy investing!"
msgstr "Lycka till!"

